OL,3,GNEWSATwitchers disrupt buses in quest
OL,4,Ato see rare bird
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirdwatchers flocking to a Norfolk
OL,7,Fvillage in hopes of spotting a rare
OL,8,Fbird have disrupted bus services.
OL,10,FAlso known as twitchers, hundreds of
OL,11,Fenthusiasts descended on Mundesley in
OL,12,FNorfolk at the weekend after a northern
OL,13,Fnutcracker was spotted in a garden on
OL,14,FFriday.
OL,16,FBus company Sanders Coaches said the
OL,17,Fenthusiasm led to some questionable
OL,18,Fparking which meant some bus services
OL,19,Fhad to be altered.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
