OL,3,GNEWSATwitchers disrupt buses in quest
OL,4,Ato see rare bird
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bird had not been seen in Norfolk
OL,7,Fsince 1968 and had not been widely
OL,8,Fspotted in the UK since 1991.
